  "description": "1) Single storey rear and side extension\n\n2) Part one, part two storey side extension\n\n3) Proposed first storey rear extension 0.87 meters deep and 3.88 meters wide to align rear wall and with\nextended roof on a top of it get enough standing height for loft stairs.\n\n4) Proposed roof extension:\nExisting roof ridge is approximately 0.7 meters lower than neighbouring house 22 and 0.37 meters lower than\nneighbouring house 18. Proposal is to align the height of the proposed roof ridge with the height of the existing \nroof ridge of the neighbouring house 22 to achieve standing height for proposed loft bedroom.\n\n5) Formation of two modest in size, rear dormers with slanting roof. Proposed dormers are set down from \nproposed roof ridge and set back from eaves. Proposed roof material are tiles and dormer cheek\nmaterial are hanging tiles matching in colour and design with roof tiles.\n\n6) Front and side sky light. Proposed sky lights are conservation style - aligned with roof tiles.\n\n",
